4,Yazghulami / Yazgulami - Max Planck Society,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Yazghulami.htm,"Yazghulami or Yazgulyam or Yazgulam is spoken by 9,000 speakers in several villages in Yazgulyam river valley, Dushanbe and Kuybishev areas, Kuhistoni Badakhshon province, Tajikistan.",Yazghulami,Indo-European
