9,Glottolog 5.3 - Yazgulyam,https://glottolog.org/resource/languoid/id/yazg1240,"Yazgulyami (3156-yah) = Vulnerable (100 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (Yazghulami is the main language used between Yazghulami speakers, regardless of age, and sometimes even in official contexts.",Yazghulami,Indo-European
